completed_at: "2026-09-02T18:20:26.400Z"
author: "harness:claude-code"
acceptance_criteria: "No reference to the template package remains anywhere in the tree; the identity gate passes against a purpose-written allowlist and baseline; the release job is gated by both the ref and the approval variable; the package builds, typechecks and its tests pass"
close_reason: "The tree carries no template references, the identity gate passes against an allowlist written for this repository rather than inherited, the release job is gated by both the ref and PM_RELEASE_APPROVED, and the copied ref-gate test was strengthened to refuse a disjunction as well as an absent gate - verified by reverting each weakening and observing it fail."
body: ""
